            <ArticleTitle>Radiation-induced stenosis of the left main coronary artery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>169-71</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of isolated left main coronary artery stenosis ten years following irradiation of the mediastinum for Hodgkin's disease is presented. Aortic biopsies were consistent with changes suggestive of radiation arteritis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
